NyatiDraw modifies src/config.rs and src/launch.rs to allow asynchronous
native-renderer retirement before event-loop exit or panic propagation.
Optional startup triage in src/app.rs, src/edits.rs, src/protocol.rs and the
src/launch.rs IPC route records first-stage initialization, interpreter calls
and acknowledgement without changing retry behavior.
See NYATIDRAW.md for provenance and the exact scope of this local patch.
